When creating or editing UI pages, components, or CSS, enforce `standards/design-system.md` and `standards/frontend.md`:

- **Anti-AI-slop:** Propose 2 distinct visual directions, justify the choice, define CSS custom-property tokens, log font/icon/image licenses, and reject purple gradients, glassmorphism, neon dark defaults, and fake testimonials/metrics.
- **All 7 UI states:** Cover `loading`, `empty`, `error`, `success`, `disabled`, `focus-visible`, and `long content` (100+ chars).
- **App Router & accessibility:** Default to Server Components; avoid mount fetch waterfalls; keep filter/search/sort/pagination in URL `searchParams`; trap modal/drawer keyboard focus (`Escape` closes & restores trigger focus); verify screenshots at `360px`, `768px`, and `1440px` (`axe-core` != full WCAG 2.2 AA conformance).
